Display range 0.0 to 255:59 h; standing time of the vehicle after ignition-off until ignition on. If no message from dash panel insert, text: ERROR; 
error status Stand time; Text : Invalid.
 The standing time signal is transmitted by the dash panel insert to control unit -J104. It is required to calculate the brake cooling time.
